<title>POLAND: POLISH GARMENT MAKER ELPO TRADES ON KERB AT PLN 24.</title>
<headline>POLISH GARMENT MAKER ELPO TRADES ON KERB AT PLN 24.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-02-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Kerb transactions of 19,750 shares and 32,000 shares in Polish garment maker Elpo SA at 24 zlotys each were struck on the Warsaw bourse on Wednesday, the bourse said in a statement.</p>
<p>On Thursday Elpo is due to become the first stock to trade on the exchange's third market for especially small issues.</p>
<p>Investors subscribed for 140,320 shares in the firm's December public offering of 600,000 shares at 22 zlotys each, with underwriters taking the rest.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
